      "status": "untested",
      "notes": "FEX 2610 Performance (TSO off), bionic, no PRoot, direct launch, Vulkan thunks, the Turnip driver chosen by the app for the GPU (DD-Turnip v0.1.1 on Adreno 840), 960x544 with the app upscaler off (preset beamng-039-linux-fex-bionic-960x544): the only preset for this version. West Coast driving measured on a Redmagic Astra 2 and a Z Fold8 Ultra (about 100-110 FPS average at BeamNG's Lowest graphics). TSO off relaxes x86 memory ordering; some launches die at startup; long sessions are unverified. Needs an app build with the FEX + bionic BeamNG fixes.",
